    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe alinjebele ati, “Buula icakulembapo cimo icikulu, ulembepo ifilembo ifikulu utile, ‘Maeri Shalali Hashi Basi’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ili shina mu Cihibulu lyatila, “Uwangufyanya ukutapa, uwanguka ukusampa.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unjitileko abantu abacishinka, shimapepo Ulia na Sakaria mwana Yeberekia, pakuti ebo bese babe bakambone bandi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo nasendeme no mukashi wandi, uwali kasesema wa mashiwi yakwa Lesa, awe aimita asuka afyala no mwana umwaume. Elyo Yawe anjeba ati, “Mwinike ishina lya Maeri Shalali Hashi Basi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu umwana akalati talaishiba nakutila, ‘Tata’ nangu ‘Mayo’, ninshi imfumu ya Asiria yalisenda kale ifyuma fyonse ifya Damasiko no kutapa Samaria onsefye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe alinsoseshe nakabili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alanjeba ati, “Pa mulandu wakuti aba bantu nabakaana amenshi ya mu kamana ka Shiloa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shiloa e kamana ako intulo yakako iyikulu yabela lwa ku kabanga ka Yerusalemu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ayapitafye tondolo, na pa mulandu wakuti aba bantu balesekela pa fikaponena imfumu Resini, ne mfumu mwana Remaliya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kanshi ine ne Yawe nalaya buula imfumu ya Asiria ne fita fyaiko fyonse, uleke ise isanse icalo ca Yuda. Abena Asiria bakulaisa nge lyeshi lya mu mumana wa Yufurate uupongwele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baleisa pongwela nge lyeshi pa calo ca Yuda, amenshi yaleisa pelela mu mikoshi, no kubunsha icalo conse. Ukufunguluka kwa mapindo yakwe kukakupa icalo cobe we Imanueli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Imanueli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, “Lesa twaba nankwe.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe alinsokele pa maka ine ne Esaya, kabili alinsokele ukuti nilakonkelela imisango iyo abantu bakwete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.14+1PE.3.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3:14-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alinjebele ati, “Iwe wilakonkelela mufyo abantu balecita, kabili tecakwesha kulatiina ifyo bena baletiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uleibukishafye ukuti Yawe umwine wa fita, ena wamushilo, kanshi eo uli nokulakwatila akatiina. Ena ekafye eo uli nokulatutuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena akaba icifulo icamushilo, nomba ku ba mu mayanda yonse yabili ayakwa Israeli akaba ilibwe ilyo abantu baipununako, no kubalenga ukutalansuka no kuwa. Ku ba mu Yerusalemu, akaba icitembo kabili iciteyo cakwikatwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi bengi bakulaipununako, no kuwa bakulawa. Bakulawa no kufunika bakulafunika. Ee, bakulaikatwa ku citeyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
