                "loc": "HEB.2.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bahi 2:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Moneni epo ndi, ine pamo na bana abo Yawe ampeela. Yawe umwine wa fita, uo icipuna cakwe icabufumu caba pa lupili lwa Sioni, nifwe abika ukuba ifishibilo kabili nge fyakumwenako kukushinina abena Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abantu nga balamweba ukwipusha imilandu ku bantu ababuka na bapendula, abalongofyanya pakulanda, nangu abatamantama pakulanda, ubaasuke auti, ‘Bushe abantu teti bepushe Lesa wabo? Mulandu nshi bengalaipushisha imilandu ya bomi ku mipashi ya bafwa?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mafunde na kufyo Lesa amukonkomesha eko muloleshe, nga tabasosa ukulingana nefi ninshi tamwaba ulubuuto muli bena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bakalalulumbafye mu calo, ilyo ninshi nabapelelwa, kabili ninshi nabafwa ulushile ku nsala. Pakuba ne insala ifyo, bakafulwa nganshi. No kupunamina kumulu, bakatuka imfumu yabo iyabateeka, bakatuke na Lesa wabo wine. Bakalati bapunamina mumulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elyo kabili balolesha amenso panshi, awe bakamonafye ubucushi bweka bweka ne mfifi no bunkukwa. Bakasunkilishiwa na mu mfifi iyikalamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
